ened inside hidden forest cinemas in beautiful venues across the country.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.enchantedchristmascinema.co.uk/images/venues/york.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png?42955e7308e4936d\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"512x512\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png?42955e7308e4936d\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"512x512\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js?dpl=dpl_Go5QdHqMn6BJpjJ1UNkhMZ9fRdb1\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><noscript><img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"display:none\" src=\"https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=1354231593278965&amp;ev=PageView&amp;noscript=1\" alt=\"\"/></noscript><canvas id=\"snow-canvas\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas><main class=\"onsale_page__OR_gw\"><header class=\"SiteHeader_bar__q7Gwt \"><a class=\"SiteHeader_logo__XTR9l \" aria-label=\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema home\" tabindex=\"-1\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/images/logo-circle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"/></a><nav class=\"SiteHeader_nav__xC76B \" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/#locations\">Venues</a><a href=\"#faqs\">FAQs</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"SiteHeader_actions__nI1Mb\"><a href=\"#tickets\" class=\"SiteHeader_book__4gm3G\">Book now</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"SiteHeader_menuButton__TVn_0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></header><section class=\"onsale_hero__9DwUj\"><img src=\"/images/venues/southampton.jpg\" alt=\"Southampton\" class=\"onsale_heroImg__tI6hq\"/><div class=\"onsale_heroFade__Gs2hQ\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><a aria-label=\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"onsale_heroLogo__mB7OH\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Go5QdHqMn6BJpjJ1UNkhMZ9fRdb1 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Go5QdHqMn6BJpjJ1UNkhMZ9fRdb1 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_Go5QdHqMn6BJpjJ1UNkhMZ9fRdb1\"/></a></section><div class=\"onsale_header__842g2\" id=\"about\"><h1 class=\"section-title\">Southampton</h1><p class=\"onsale_subtitle__Y1Vom\">16th – 18th Dec</p><p class=\"onsale_blurb__mJAEz\">Teaming up with renowned music venue Turner Sims, we have transformed this music hall into an enchanted forest cinema where you will enjoy a live music performance and snowfall before every screening.</p></div><div class=\"onsale_pricesBlock__cz923\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"onsale_pricesLink__Z35VN\"><div class=\"TicketPricing_row__vxAjV\"><div class=\"TicketPricing_ticket__8z2HM\"><div class=\"TicketPricing_label__m_3U7\">Adult</div><div class=\"TicketPricing_price__bJYYx\">£19.50</div></div><div class=\"TicketPricing_ticket__8z2HM\"><div class=\"TicketPricing_label__m_3U7\">Child</div><div class=\"TicketPricing_price__bJYYx\">£15</div><div class=\"TicketPricing_subLabel__pWDP0\">(under 12)</div></div></div><p class=\"onsale_pricesFootnote__29Myz\">Prices may vary by screening.</p></button></div><section class=\"ScreeningsSection_section__GjfvH\" id=\"tickets\"><div class=\"wrap\"><h2 class=\"section-title\">BOOK NOW</h2><div class=\"ScreeningsSection_viewToggle__NjAYT\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose view\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ScreeningsSection_toggleBtn___HPbe ScreeningsSection_toggleActive__xU557\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Grid</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ScreeningsSection_toggleBtn___HPbe \" aria-pressed=\"false\">List</button></div><div class=\"ScreeningsSection_day__RkMvT\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ScreeningsSection_dayHeader__yY9FR\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span>Wed 16th Dec</span><svg class=\"ScreeningsSection_chevron__nzGJd ScreeningsSection_chevronOpen__NVrAA\" width=\