\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-16 20:15\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/love-actually-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-17 14:00\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/miracle-on-34th-street-1947-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-17 16:15\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/the-muppet-christmas-carol-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-17 18:15\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/home-alone/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-17 20:30\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/elf-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-18 13:30\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/love-actually-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-18 16:15\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/the-muppet-christmas-carol-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-18 18:15\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/elf-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\",\\\"2026-12-18 20:30\\\":\\\"https://www.turnersims.co.uk/whats-on/the-holiday-enchanted-christmas-cinema/?utm_source=enchantedchristmascinema\\u0026utm_medium=referral\\u0026utm_campaign=southampton_onsale\\\"},\\\"id\\\":\\\"tickets\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"BOOK NOW\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"TicketShopEmbed_address__77FGx\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"TicketShopEmbed_addressLabel__zbVHr\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Location\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"TicketShopEmbed_addressText__D_Rr5\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Turner Sims, Building 52, Highfield Campus, University of Southampton, SO17 1BJ\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"TicketShopEmbed_addressText__D_Rr5\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Box Office: 023 8059 5151\\\"}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"Quote_section__dHB5c\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"blockquote\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"“\\\",\\\"Step into a magical, hidden setting to watch your favourite Christmas movie.\\\",\\\"”\\\"]}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L10\\\",null,{\\\"venueName\\\":\\\"Southampton\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"category\\\":\\\"General\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is the cinema indoors?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yes! The whole experience takes place indoors, inside the Turner Sims concert hall, transformed into an enchanted woodland cinema.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What happens before the film?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Every screening begins with a 15-minute live performance of classic Christmas songs on piano and vocals. Then, as the lights go down, snow falls in front of the screen and the film begins.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is there an age restriction?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Each film is shown at its official age rating, and under-16s must be with an adult at all Turner Sims events.\\\",\\\"Love Actually is rated 15: all guests must be aged 15 or over, and anyone under 15 will be denied entry. This is required by the film’s age rating.\\\",\\\"The Holiday is rated 12 (not 12A): all guests must be aged 12 or over, and anyone under 12 will be denied entry, even with an adult. This is required by the film’s age rating.\\\",\\\"Turner Sims staff may ask for ID.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is food and drink included in my ticket?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Food and drink aren't included in your ticket, but the Turner Sims bar has you covered, with mulled wine, popcorn and festive treats from an hour before each screening. Drinks can be taken into the hall. See [Eat and drink](https://www.turnersims.co.uk/plan-your-visit/eat-and-drink/).\\\",\\\"Turner Sims is cashless: cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay are accepted (not American Express).\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I take photos or film?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Please don’t film or take photos during the live music or the film, and switch your phone off once the show begins.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is there a cloakroom?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"There’s no staffed cloakroom, but there are coat hooks near the toilets. Please keep valuables with you.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Getting here\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Where is the venue?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Turner Sims, Building 52, Highfield Campus, University of Southampton, SO17 1BJ (what3words: ///buddy.impact.arts).\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"How do I get there, and is there parking?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Parking on campus is free after 5pm on weekdays. The nearest spaces are at the far end of Chamberlain Road, and Blue Badge bays are at the back of the building. Before 5pm on weekdays, parking is Pay and Display.\\\",\\\"By bus: Uni-Link U2B or U6H from Southampton Central, or U1C from Southampton Airport Parkway.\\\",\\\"See [Getting to Turner Sims](https://www.turnersims.co.uk/plan-your-visit/getting-to-turner-sims/) for full travel details.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What time should I arrive?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"The bar opens an hour before the start time on your ticket. Please be in your seat by the start time: that’s when the live music begins, and the film follows about 15 minutes later.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Ticketing\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What’s the difference in seating?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"All seats in a screening are the same price. Turner Sims is a purpose-built concert hall, so every seat has a fantastic view of the screen.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Why do prices vary between screenings?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Ticket prices vary by screening, from off-peak to peak. The price for each screening is shown when you book.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"I can’t find my tickets\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Turner Sims emails your e-tickets when you book. If you can’t find them, contact the Turner Sims Box Office on 023 8059 5151 or info@turnersims.co.uk.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Do you offer free tickets for carers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yes. Turner Sims offers a free ticket for a personal assistant. Register your access needs on your Turner Sims account first, or call the Box Office on 023 8059 5151. See their [Access information](https://www.turnersims.co.uk/access/).\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I get a refund or exchange my tickets?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Tickets can’t be refunded unless a screening is cancelled. For anything else, contact the Turner Sims Box Office on 023 8059 5151. See [Booking tickets](https://www.turnersims.co.uk/plan-your-visit/booking-tickets/).\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Accessibility\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is the venue accessible?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yes. There’s step-free access to the Box Office, bar, toilets and wheelchair spaces, and accessible toilets on site. Wheelchair spaces can be booked online once you’ve registered your access needs, or by calling 023 8059 5151.\\\",\\\"Sensory packs with ear defenders can be borrowed, and assistance dogs are welcome (please let Turner Sims know in advance).\\\",\\\"See Turner Sims’ [Access information](https://www.turnersims.co.uk/access/) for full details.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Contact\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"How do I contact you?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Turner Sims Box Office (tickets): 023 8059 5151 or info@turnersims.co.uk, 1.30–4.30pm Monday to Friday and from two hours before each screening.\\\",\\\"Everything else: Hello@EnchantedChristmasCinema.co.uk\\\"]}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"footer\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_footer__pQtti\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lc\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_logo__fUEOF\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema home\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/logo-circle.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"84\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"84\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_social__cGivK\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.facebook.com/p/Enchanted-Christmas-Cinema-61594111108877/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema on Facebook\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"width\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M13.5 22v-8h2.7l.4-3.2h-3.1V8.8c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V4.4c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.3H7.4V14h2.7v8h3.4z\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.instagram.com/enchantedchristmascinema/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema on Instagram\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"width\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"rect\\\",null,{