sName\\\":\\\"Quote_section__dHB5c\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"wrap\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"blockquote\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"“\\\",\\\"It’s a great family tradition and the perfect way to kick off Christmas.\\\",\\\"”\\\"]}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L14\\\",null,{\\\"venueName\\\":\\\"York\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"category\\\":\\\"General\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is the cinema indoors?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yes! You certainly don’t need to worry about the weather when visiting our venue. The experience and cinema screen are all located indoors.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is there an age restriction?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"The recommended age for the experience is 4 years +. Kids prices are available for select shows and babes in arms are welcome, but please note that there is no buggy storage and buggies are not permitted inside the venue.\\\",\\\"Anyone 17 years or under must be accompanied by an adult of 18+ years at all times (this includes within the cinema). Age certification for films apply regardless. For 15 and 18 rated films, our staff are legally required to ask for proof that you are old enough to watch an age restricted film if they have any doubt. In order to prove your age we require an official I.D. that includes a photo and date of birth such as a passport or driver’s licence.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is food and drink included in my ticket?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Food and drink aren't included in your ticket, but you won't go short! Our cosy bar serves mulled wine, alcoholic and soft drinks, popcorn and festive treats, so grab your favourites before the film starts. There's no hot food, but you're in the heart of York, with plenty of places to eat before or after your show.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I bring my own food \\u0026 drink to the venue?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"We’re afraid not! We have plenty of cinema snacks and drink options available so you won't be short of festive treats!\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"How do I redeem my pre-purchased food \\u0026 drink?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"You can redeem your pre-purchased food \\u0026 drink at any of our bars when ordering. Easy peasy!\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Getting here\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Where is the venue located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema is located at the Yorkshire Museum, Museum Gardens, Museum Street, York YO1 7FR\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What is the venue address?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yorkshire Museum, Museum Gardens, Museum Street, York YO1 7FR\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What time should I arrive?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Please arrive at least 15 minutes before your show start time to ensure you have enough time to get your drinks \\u0026 snacks before finding your seats. Films start promptly at the start time on your ticket (no 20 minutes of adverts like standard cinemas)\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What are the nearest transport links?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"The nearest bus stop is on Museum Street where the number 2 bus stops. It is then a short, slightly sloped walk to the museum entrance. There are several other bus stops nearby. For more information visit www.itravelyork.info/buses. You can also use the city’s park and ride service.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is there parking?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"The nearest car park is on Marygate, which has 350 car parking spaces and Blue Badge parking.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Facilities\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is there a cloakroom?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"There is no cloakroom or luggage storage facilities on site. Bags larger than A4 are not permitted. If you are planning on arriving with luggage, we advise using luggage storage facilities before you arrive.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Are buggies allowed?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Buggies are not permitted in the venue and there is no buggy storage available.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What happens when I arrive?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Your tickets will be scanned as you arrive. Please ensure you have them downloaded and ready to scan. Screenshots of tickets will not be accepted. Once you have entered the venue you will have a chance to get your snacks and drinks before heading to the enchanted forest cinema.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Ticketing\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What’s the difference in seating?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"All seats are priced the same and allocated with a number and seat number. The auditorium is purpose built for these kinds of events and so all seats have a fantastic view of the screen.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"I can’t find my tickets\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Digital tickets will be sent to you in your confirmation email at the time of purchase. Please ensure you have downloaded your tickets on your device before arriving.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Do you offer free tickets for carers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Carer tickets are free of charge. When booking your chosen date, please select the carer ticket option from the drop down menu. Each carer ticket must be purchased with at least one other full-price ticket.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"I can no longer attend, can I get a refund?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"All ticket sales are final and non-refundable, except in extreme circumstances (please get in touch and we'll review this on a case-by-case basis).\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I exchange my tickets?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Yes, subject to availability, you can exchange your ticket for a different date up to 7 days before your original screening, directly through the Beyonk ticketing system.\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Accessibility\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"Is the venue wheelchair accessible?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"The venue is wheelchair accessible and all on one level.\\\",\\\"We have dedicated wheelchair spaces available to select on the booking page.\\\"]},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"What should I expect during the experience?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"This is not your standard cinema, there will be lights, decorations, possible use of haze and snow machines. If you have any concerns and would like a full breakdown of what will happen at the experience please contact us at Hello@EnchantedChristmasCinema.co.uk\\\"]}]},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"Contact\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"How do I contact you?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[\\\"Hello@EnchantedChristmasCinema.co.uk\\\"]}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"footer\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_footer__pQtti\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$Lc\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_logo__fUEOF\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema home\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"img\\\",null,{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/images/logo-circle.png\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"width\\\":\\\"84\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"84\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"Footer_social__cGivK\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.facebook.com/p/Enchanted-Christmas-Cinema-61594111108877/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema on Facebook\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"width\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"height\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M13.5 22v-8h2.7l.4-3.2h-3.1V8.8c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V4.4c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.3H7.4V14h2.7v8h3.4z\\\"}]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.instagram.com/enchantedchristmascinema/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"aria-label\\\":\\\"Enchanted Christmas Cinema on Instagram\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"width\\\":\\\"22\\\",\\\"height\\\